p=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6cf8596c5989255f81464dee4b641425 3x"}, "body": "リズ男様\n\nはじめまして。個人Vtuberとして活動しております猫屋ナギと申します。\nリズ男様の素敵なイラストを拝見し、是非自分のイラストを描いて頂けないかと思いリクエストを送らせて頂きました。\n\n描いて頂いたイラストはSNSや配信サムネイル等で使用させていただければと思っております。\n構図、ポーズなどはお任せします。背景と人物を別レイヤーにしたpsdファイルで頂けるととても助かります。\n\n参考\nhttps://twitter.com/Nekoya_Nagi_V/status/1512763959740297221?s=20&t=Fa-zmqvB-vyoPn4-ynhH4g\n\nどちらの衣装でも大丈夫です。\nご都合合いましたらよろしくお願い致します。\n\n猫屋ナギ", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@risottokokoto1/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1874670, "client_id": 1602736, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3643658af62d9aa783fcddad9f0f225", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3643658af62d9aa783fcddad9f0f225, https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=415c36639ef445ca79c1f21ec56d7e2f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6564fe1b7eb71f18d79b878bf9611292 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4808b411a19b9126c01311d11556e23e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4808b411a19b9126c01311d11556e23e, https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6ac64676f95b0cd1c057c06c6598f502 2x, https://si.imgix.net/98047bc0/uploads/origins/fa07b9f0-779c-4958-8a6a-ef0cc3bec090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a480ca40b50e9d41b54bd7174bc3c35 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは～、あなたの画風がとても好きです！できれば絵をお願いしたいです。\n\n私のキャラクター「エイル」の絵を描いていただきたいです。傭兵で、冷たいけど優しい性格で、二羽のカラスをとても可愛がっています。ポーズや構図はお任せしますが、鳥が描かれているものを希望します。\n\n以下、参考資料です。ご検討、本当にありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/45437602_5HT4vkMF1j9EVti.png\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/38309795_G8pLOC687eTAiHe.png", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@risottokokoto1/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1874670, "client_id": 1219025, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a679ab42d225df86121a9f1dd65c6b8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a679ab42d225df86121a9f1dd65c6b8, https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d04e1272e875c19e95ad4e3f3cf3e0f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8259f3df9f9879afb0c3cf4b26d546b3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06a4891c78d19e3054ab7b81def4bcda", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06a4891c78d19e3054ab7b81def4bcda, https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ee4c00ae481236a7b9a0a1a2d3cf243a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/46f86749/uploads/origins/68f4064b-84c0-4f90-8e60-3bcb6d645499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27cdd27440c4d2945d5df4593d5e6975 3x"}, "body": "Your work is amazing! Please draw my VTuber character. He has a mature face and gothic fashion.\nImage: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/833851321987629056/937345001866821652/unknown.png\nIf you need more images, I have previous Skeb on my profile.\nPlease pose him with an orange sunset behind him.\nHe has fangs and a mole under his lips, with snake slit eyes and lots of earrings.\nThank you!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@risottokokoto1/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1874670, "client_id": 1906749, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2358308/uploads/origins/555f4144-4fa0-45c0-988e-1f9e2ceb42d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af5d889453ba065892f21fd5776ab36f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2358308/uploads/origins/555f4144-4fa0-45c0-988e-1f9e2ceb42d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af5d889453ba065892f21fd5776ab36f, https://si.imgix.net/a2358308/uploads/origins/555f4144-4fa0-45c0-988e-